        rdfs:label "Drosophila mauritiana Turing wavelength at 1.6 µm (Pass 2, assimilated ocellus) — Parameter expressivity: 91/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "λ(D_v/D_u) rises from about 1.53 µm at ratio 7.5 to about 1.74 µm at 13.5, through the operating point 9.875. The melanogaster successor (ratio × 1.22) is marked on the same curve at 1.701 µm. The control with the ratio forced to 1 does not pattern." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
